# Place build assets here:
#   - style.csl       -> Citation Style Language file (Nature Protocols).
#                        Download from https://github.com/citation-style-language/styles
#                        and save as `nature-protocols.csl` (or symlink to style.csl).
#   - reference.docx  -> Optional reference Word doc for `pandoc -t docx`.
#   - thumbnail.png   -> Optional social/preview image.
